{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13535","headline":"北游还酬孟云卿 · 张彪","name":"北游还酬孟云卿","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"忽忽忘前事，志愿能相乖。\n衣马久羸弊，谁信文与才。\n善道居贫贱，洁服蒙尘埃。\n行行无定心，壈坎难归来。\n慈母忧疾疹，至家念栖哀。\n与君宿姻亲，深见中外怀。\n俟余惜时节，伥望临高台。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张彪","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_13535.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13535","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}